[{"id":"bayyana-2-242-1","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojašnjava","en":"makes clear"},{"bs":"da pojasnimo","en":"so that we may make clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo","en":"we made clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"}],"ref":"2:242","answerWord":"يُبَيِّنُ","answerSound":"audio/66c9999092edbf1de221.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus Allah expoundeth unto you His revelations so that ye may understand.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["كَذَٰلِكَ","يُبَيِّنُ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-2-68-4","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojašnjava","en":"he/it makes clear"},{"bs":"i pojasne","en":"and make clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"},{"bs":"i da pojasnim","en":"and so that I may make clear"}],"ref":"2:68","answerWord":"يُبَيِّن","answerSound":"audio/caf25581de67062a7998.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Pray for us unto thy Lord that He make clear to us what (cow) she is. (Moses) answered: Lo! He saith, Verily she is a cow neither with calf nor immature; (she is) between the two conditions; so do that which ye are commanded.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","ٱدْعُ","لَنَا","رَبَّكَ","يُبَيِّن","لَّنَا","مَا","هِىَ","قَالَ","إِنَّهُۥ","يَقُولُ","إِنَّهَا","بَقَرَةٌ","لَّا","فَارِضٌ","وَلَا","بِكْرٌ","عَوَانٌۢ","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَٱفْعَلُوا۟","مَا","تُؤْمَرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-2-118-20","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojasnili smo","en":"we made clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjavamo","en":"we make clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjava ih","en":"he/it makes them clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjava","en":"makes clear"}],"ref":"2:118","answerWord":"بَيَّنَّا","answerSound":"audio/59e0dc5bb91a36e05abc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who have no knowledge say: Why doth not Allah speak unto us, or some sign come unto us? Even thus, as they now speak, spake those (who were) before them. Their hearts are all alike. We have made clear the revelations for people who are sure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ","لَوْلَا","يُكَلِّمُنَا","ٱللَّهُ","أَوْ","تَأْتِينَآ","ءَايَةٌ","كَذَٰلِكَ","قَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِم","مِّثْلَ","قَوْلِهِمْ","تَشَٰبَهَتْ","قُلُوبُهُمْ","قَدْ","بَيَّنَّا","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يُوقِنُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-4-26-2","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"da pojasni","en":"so that he/it may make clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjavamo","en":"we make clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo","en":"we made clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjava ih","en":"he/it makes them clear"}],"ref":"4:26","answerWord":"لِيُبَيِّنَ","answerSound":"audio/d5809c2bb72ef6e99184.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah would explain to you and guide you by the examples of those who were before you, and would turn to you in mercy. Allah is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["يُرِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيُبَيِّنَ","لَكُمْ","وَيَهْدِيَكُمْ","سُنَنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِكُمْ","وَيَتُوبَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-2-159-11","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"},{"bs":"i da pojasnim","en":"and so that I may make clear"},{"bs":"da pojasni","en":"so that he/it may make clear"},{"bs":"i pojasne","en":"and make clear"}],"ref":"2:159","answerWord":"بَيَّنَّٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/cf27a8d4d14b284c9069.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who hide the proofs and the guidance which We revealed, after We had made it clear to mankind in the Scripture: such are accursed of Allah and accursed of those who have the power to curse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","أَنزَلْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلْهُدَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","بَيَّنَّٰهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","فِى","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّٰعِنُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-2-160-4","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"i pojasne","en":"and make clear"},{"bs":"da pojasni","en":"so that he/it may make clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjavamo","en":"we make clear"},{"bs":"i da pojasnim","en":"and so that I may make clear"}],"ref":"2:160","answerWord":"وَبَيَّنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a18a47d0482f28d7d7c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Except those who repent and amend and make manifest (the truth). These it is toward whom I relent. I am the Relenting, the Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","تَابُوا۟","وَأَصْلَحُوا۟","وَبَيَّنُوا۟","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَتُوبُ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَأَنَا","ٱلتَّوَّابُ","ٱلرَّحِيمُ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-2-230-27","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojašnjava ih","en":"he/it makes them clear"},{"bs":"i pojašnjava","en":"and he/it makes clear"},{"bs":"zaista ćete je pojasniti","en":"surely you (all) will make it clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"}],"ref":"2:230","answerWord":"يُبَيِّنُهَا","answerSound":"audio/059f1ead75b16a80340d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if he hath divorced her (the third time), then she is not lawful unto him thereafter until she hath wedded another husband. Then if he (the other husband) divorce her it is no sin for both of them that they come together again if they consider that they are able to observe the limits of Allah. These are the limits of Allah. He manifesteth them for people who have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["فَإِن","طَلَّقَهَا","فَلَا","تَحِلُّ","لَهُۥ","مِنۢ","بَعْدُ","حَتَّىٰ","تَنكِحَ","زَوْجًا","غَيْرَهُۥ","فَإِن","طَلَّقَهَا","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْهِمَآ","أَن","يَتَرَاجَعَآ","إِن","ظَنَّآ","أَن","يُقِيمَا","حُدُودَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَتِلْكَ","حُدُودُ","ٱللَّهِ","يُبَيِّنُهَا","لِقَوْمٍ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[27],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-3-187-7","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćete je pojasniti","en":"surely you (all) will make it clear"},{"bs":"i pojasne","en":"and make clear"},{"bs":"da pojasnimo","en":"so that we may make clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"}],"ref":"3:187","answerWord":"لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/7abba737537efa47b842.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Allah laid a charge on those who had received the Scripture (He said): Ye are to expound it to mankind and not to hide it. But they flung it behind their backs and bought thereby a little gain. Verily evil is that which they have gained thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِيثَٰقَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ","لِلنَّاسِ","وَلَا","تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ","فَنَبَذُوهُ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِهِمْ","وَٱشْتَرَوْا۟","بِهِۦ","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","فَبِئْسَ","مَا","يَشْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-5-75-18","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojašnjavamo","en":"we make clear"},{"bs":"i zaista će pojasniti","en":"and surely he/it will make clear"},{"bs":"zaista ćete je pojasniti","en":"surely you (all) will make it clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo","en":"we made clear"}],"ref":"5:75","answerWord":"نُبَيِّنُ","answerSound":"audio/5d13e1b2393f8b471ff3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Messiah, son of Mary, was no other than a messenger, messengers (the like of whom) had passed away before him. And his mother was a saintly woman. And they both used to eat (earthly) food. See how We make the revelations clear for them, and see how they are turned away!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["مَّا","ٱلْمَسِيحُ","ٱبْنُ","مَرْيَمَ","إِلَّا","رَسُولٌ","قَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِهِ","ٱلرُّسُلُ","وَأُمُّهُۥ","صِدِّيقَةٌ","كَانَا","يَأْكُلَانِ","ٱلطَّعَامَ","ٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","نُبَيِّنُ","لَهُمُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","ٱنظُرْ","أَنَّىٰ","يُؤْفَكُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-9-115-9","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"pojašnjava","en":"he/it makes clear"},{"bs":"zaista ćete je pojasniti","en":"surely you (all) will make it clear"},{"bs":"i da pojasnim","en":"and so that I may make clear"},{"bs":"pojasnili smo ga","en":"we made it clear"}],"ref":"9:115","answerWord":"يُبَيِّنَ","answerSound":"audio/94b5afbb7e7971b29538.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was never Allah's (part) that He should send a folk astray after He had guided them until He had made clear unto them what they should avoid. Lo! Allah is Aware of all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيُضِلَّ","قَوْمًۢا","بَعْدَ","إِذْ","هَدَىٰهُمْ","حَتَّىٰ","يُبَيِّنَ","لَهُم","مَّا","يَتَّقُونَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","بِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"bayyana-43-63-8","words":["verb:bayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"i da pojasnim","en":"and so that I may make clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjava","en":"he/it makes clear"},{"bs":"zaista ćete je pojasniti","en":"surely you (all) will make it clear"},{"bs":"pojašnjava ih","en":"he/it makes them clear"}],"ref":"43:63","answerWord":"وَلِأُبَيِّنَ","answerSound":"audio/6518fb61d042550d9505.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When Jesus came with clear proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty), he said: I have come unto you with wisdom, and to make plain some of that concerning which ye differ. So keep your duty to Allah, and obey me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pojasniti, objasniti","en":"to make clear, to explain"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَ","عِيسَىٰ","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","قَالَ","قَدْ","جِئْتُكُم","بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ","وَلِأُبَيِّنَ","لَكُم","بَعْضَ","ٱلَّذِى","تَخْتَلِفُونَ","فِيهِ","فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُونِ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"بَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"anja-7-64-1","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga spasili","en":"so we saved him"},{"bs":"pa smo ih spasili","en":"so we saved them"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"spasili smo vas","en":"we saved you (all)"}],"ref":"7:64","answerWord":"فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/69472273a5d681a44345.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But they denied him, so We saved him and those with him in the ship, and We drowned those who denied Our tokens. Lo! they were blind folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","مَعَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْفُلْكِ","وَأَغْرَقْنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","إِنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","قَوْمًا","عَمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-7-141-1","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo vas","en":"we saved you (all)"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"spasi ga","en":"it saves him"}],"ref":"7:141","answerWord":"أَنجَيْنَٰكُم","answerSound":"audio/4f4bafaaef668d715c11.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when We did deliver you from Pharaoh's folk who were afflicting you with dreadful torment, slaughtering your sons and sparing your women. That was a tremendous trial from your Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَنجَيْنَٰكُم","مِّنْ","ءَالِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","يَسُومُونَكُمْ","سُوٓءَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","يُقَتِّلُونَ","أَبْنَآءَكُمْ","وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ","نِسَآءَكُمْ","وَفِى","ذَٰلِكُم","بَلَآءٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-7-165-5","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"spasi ga","en":"it saves him"},{"bs":"spasio si nas","en":"you saved us"},{"bs":"spašavamo","en":"we save"}],"ref":"7:165","answerWord":"أَنجَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/e4c505d8bf7b9953c0d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they forgot that whereof they had been reminded, We rescued those who forbade wrong, and visited those who did wrong with dreadful punishment because they were evil-livers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","نَسُوا۟","مَا","ذُكِّرُوا۟","بِهِۦٓ","أَنجَيْنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلسُّوٓءِ","وَأَخَذْنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","بِعَذَابٍۭ","بَـِٔيسٍۭ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْسُقُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-26-65-0","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and We saved"},{"bs":"spasio si nas","en":"you saved us"},{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"},{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"}],"ref":"26:65","answerWord":"وَأَنجَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/0cf4d64e04dc1eeb07ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We saved Moses and those with him, every one;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَأَنجَيْنَا","مُوسَىٰ","وَمَن","مَّعَهُۥٓ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-6-63-11","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"spasili smo vas","en":"we saved you (all)"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and We saved"},{"bs":"spašavamo","en":"we save"}],"ref":"6:63","answerWord":"أَنجَىٰنَا","answerSound":"audio/292df1ab9f13a11faf14.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Who delivereth you from the darkness of the land and the sea? Ye call upon Him humbly and in secret, (saying): If we are delivered from this (fear) we truly will be of the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["قُلْ","مَن","يُنَجِّيكُم","مِّن","ظُلُمَٰتِ","ٱلْبَرِّ","وَٱلْبَحْرِ","تَدْعُونَهُۥ","تَضَرُّعًا","وَخُفْيَةً","لَّئِنْ","أَنجَىٰنَا","مِنْ","هَٰذِهِۦ","لَنَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-10-23-1","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"},{"bs":"spasi ga","en":"it saves him"},{"bs":"spasio si nas","en":"you saved us"}],"ref":"10:23","answerWord":"أَنجَىٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/cb9e99ca367e9f30ae24.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet when He hath delivered them, behold! they rebel in the earth wrongfully. O mankind! Your rebellion is only against yourselves. (Ye have) enjoyment of the life of the world; then unto Us is your return and We shall proclaim unto you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَلَمَّآ","أَنجَىٰهُمْ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يَبْغُونَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","بِغَيْرِ","ٱلْحَقِّ","يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","إِنَّمَا","بَغْيُكُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِكُم","مَّتَٰعَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْنَا","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","فَنُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-10-103-8","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spašavamo","en":"we save"},{"bs":"spasio si nas","en":"you saved us"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and We saved"},{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"}],"ref":"10:103","answerWord":"نُنجِ","answerSound":"audio/20e8d5d4786e49f0e165.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then shall We save Our messengers and the believers, in like manner (as of old). It is incumbent upon Us to save believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","نُنَجِّى","رُسُلَنَا","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","كَذَٰلِكَ","حَقًّا","عَلَيْنَا","نُنجِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-14-6-9","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"},{"bs":"pa smo ih spasili","en":"so we saved them"},{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"}],"ref":"14:6","answerWord":"أَنجَىٰكُم","answerSound":"audio/b8b4993e4c3d23b2edb5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remind them) how Moses said unto his people: Remember Allah's favour unto you when He delivered you from Pharaoh's folk who were afflicting you with dreadful torment, and were slaying your sons and sparing your women; that was a tremendous trial from your Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِ","ٱذْكُرُوا۟","نِعْمَةَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِذْ","أَنجَىٰكُم","مِّنْ","ءَالِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","يَسُومُونَكُمْ","سُوٓءَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","وَيُذَبِّحُونَ","أَبْنَآءَكُمْ","وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ","نِسَآءَكُمْ","وَفِى","ذَٰلِكُم","بَلَآءٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-21-9-3","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ih spasili","en":"so we saved them"},{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"}],"ref":"21:9","answerWord":"فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ee6002bcc4125969ca52.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we fulfilled the promise unto them. So we delivered them and whom We would, and We destroyed the prodigals.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","صَدَقْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْوَعْدَ","فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُمْ","وَمَن","نَّشَآءُ","وَأَهْلَكْنَا","ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-21-88-6","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spašavamo","en":"we save"},{"bs":"pa smo ga spasili","en":"so we saved him"},{"bs":"spasi ga","en":"it saves him"},{"bs":"spasio si nas","en":"you saved us"}],"ref":"21:88","answerWord":"نُۨجِى","answerSound":"audio/1219e01cb8318206a1bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we heard his prayer and saved him from the anguish. Thus we save believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَٱسْتَجَبْنَا","لَهُۥ","وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَمِّ","وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نُۨجِى","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-29-24-10","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"},{"bs":"pa smo ih spasili","en":"so we saved them"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and We saved"},{"bs":"pa smo ga spasili","en":"so we saved him"}],"ref":"29:24","answerWord":"فَأَنجَىٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/0241f82a60665b2a284f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But the answer of his folk was only that they said: \"Kill him\" or \"Burn him.\" Then Allah saved him from the Fire. Lo! herein verily are portents for folk who believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَمَا","كَانَ","جَوَابَ","قَوْمِهِۦٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","قَالُوا۟","ٱقْتُلُوهُ","أَوْ","حَرِّقُوهُ","فَأَنجَىٰهُ","ٱللَّهُ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّارِ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"anja-70-14-5","words":["verb:anja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasi ga","en":"it saves him"},{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"pa ga je spasio","en":"so he/it saved him"},{"bs":"spašavamo","en":"we save"}],"ref":"70:14","answerWord":"يُنجِيهِ","answerSound":"audio/62afd0c7779cb5724fa5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And all that are in the earth, if then it might deliver him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti, izbaviti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَمَن","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","جَمِيعًا","ثُمَّ","يُنجِيهِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنجَى"}},{"id":"tabayyana-8-6-4","words":["verb:tabayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"postalo jasno","en":"it had become clear"},{"bs":"pa provjerite!","en":"so (you all) verify!"},{"bs":"postaje jasno","en":"he/it becomes clear"},{"bs":"uvidjela je","en":"she/it realized"}],"ref":"8:6","answerWord":"تَبَيَّنَ","answerSound":"audio/4328093b6b0a0ea2f8a0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Disputing with thee of the Truth after it had been made manifest, as if they were being driven to death visible.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati jasno, razjasniti se","en":"to become clear"},"passage":["يُجَٰدِلُونَكَ","فِى","ٱلْحَقِّ","بَعْدَمَا","تَبَيَّنَ","كَأَنَّمَا","يُسَاقُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَوْتِ","وَهُمْ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"تَبَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"tabayyana-2-256-5","words":["verb:tabayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"postalo je jasno","en":"he/it became clear"},{"bs":"pa provjerite!","en":"so (you all) verify!"},{"bs":"postaje jasno","en":"he/it becomes clear"},{"bs":"uvidjela je","en":"she/it realized"}],"ref":"2:256","answerWord":"تَّبَيَّنَ","answerSound":"audio/eb5a96eead6efbc81fb8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There is no compulsion in religion. The right direction is henceforth distinct from error. And he who rejecteth false deities and believeth in Allah hath grasped a firm handhold which will never break. Allah is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati jasno, razjasniti se","en":"to become clear"},"passage":["لَآ","إِكْرَاهَ","فِى","ٱلدِّينِ","قَد","تَّبَيَّنَ","ٱلرُّشْدُ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَىِّ","فَمَن","يَكْفُرْ","بِٱلطَّٰغُوتِ","وَيُؤْمِنۢ","بِٱللَّهِ","فَقَدِ","ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","بِٱلْعُرْوَةِ","ٱلْوُثْقَىٰ","لَا","ٱنفِصَامَ","لَهَا","وَٱللَّهُ","سَمِيعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"تَبَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"tabayyana-14-45-6","words":["verb:tabayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"i postalo je jasno","en":"and he/it became clear"},{"bs":"pa provjerite!","en":"so (you all) verify!"},{"bs":"uvidjela je","en":"she/it realized"},{"bs":"postaje jasno","en":"he/it becomes clear"}],"ref":"14:45","answerWord":"وَتَبَيَّنَ","answerSound":"audio/3493a0a7f814688ce2d6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (have ye not) dwelt in the dwellings of those who wronged themselves (of old) and (hath it not) become plain to you how We dealt with them and made examples for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati jasno, razjasniti se","en":"to become clear"},"passage":["وَسَكَنتُمْ","فِى","مَسَٰكِنِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَتَبَيَّنَ","لَكُمْ","كَيْفَ","فَعَلْنَا","بِهِمْ","وَضَرَبْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْأَمْثَالَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"تَبَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"tabayyana-34-14-15","words":["verb:tabayyana"],"options":[{"bs":"uvidjela je","en":"she/it realized"},{"bs":"pa provjerite!","en":"so (you all) verify!"},{"bs":"postaje jasno","en":"he/it becomes clear"},{"bs":"postalo je jasno","en":"he/it became clear"}],"ref":"34:14","answerWord":"تَبَيَّنَتِ","answerSound":"audio/fa56c01a8de4b163da12.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We decreed death for him, nothing showed his death to them save a creeping creature of the earth which gnawed away his staff. And when he fell the jinn saw clearly how, if they had known the Unseen, they would not have continued in despised toil.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati jasno, razjasniti se","en":"to become clear"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","قَضَيْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","مَا","دَلَّهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","مَوْتِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","دَآبَّةُ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","تَأْكُلُ","مِنسَأَتَهُۥ","فَلَمَّا","خَرَّ","تَبَيَّنَتِ","ٱلْجِنُّ","أَن","لَّوْ","كَانُوا۟","يَعْلَمُونَ","ٱلْغَيْبَ","مَا","لَبِثُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْعَذَابِ","ٱلْمُهِينِ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"تَبَيَّنَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-52-38-3","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušaju","en":"they listen"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"},{"bs":"zato slušaj","en":"so listen"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"}],"ref":"52:38","answerWord":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7e790e869227a12cba9d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or have they any stairway (unto heaven) by means of which they overhear (decrees). Then let their listener produce some warrant manifest!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["أَمْ","لَهُمْ","سُلَّمٌ","يَسْتَمِعُونَ","فِيهِ","فَلْيَأْتِ","مُسْتَمِعُهُم","بِسُلْطَٰنٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-7-204-3","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa slušajte!","en":"so (you all) listen!"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"},{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"}],"ref":"7:204","answerWord":"فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/12edadd7cf73af8ca1ec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the Qur'an is recited, give ear to it and pay heed, that ye may obtain mercy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قُرِئَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","لَهُۥ","وَأَنصِتُوا۟","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُرْحَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-20-13-2","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"zato slušaj","en":"so listen"},{"bs":"slušaju","en":"they listen"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"},{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"}],"ref":"20:13","answerWord":"فَٱسْتَمِعْ","answerSound":"audio/25fbc923c6e3b6fac66e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And I have chosen thee, so hearken unto that which is inspired.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["وَأَنَا","ٱخْتَرْتُكَ","فَٱسْتَمِعْ","لِمَا","يُوحَىٰٓ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-21-2-8","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušaju ga","en":"they listen to it"},{"bs":"pa slušajte!","en":"so (you all) listen!"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"},{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"}],"ref":"21:2","answerWord":"ٱسْتَمَعُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/027edbafed9a1f4220c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Never cometh there unto them a new reminder from their Lord but they listen to it while they play,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["مَا","يَأْتِيهِم","مِّن","ذِكْرٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّهِم","مُّحْدَثٍ","إِلَّا","ٱسْتَمَعُوهُ","وَهُمْ","يَلْعَبُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-26-25-4","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"},{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"},{"bs":"zato slušaj","en":"so listen"}],"ref":"26:25","answerWord":"تَسْتَمِعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/26ae2d06fe4e26b422ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Pharaoh) said unto those around him: Hear ye not?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["قَالَ","لِمَنْ","حَوْلَهُۥٓ","أَلَا","تَسْتَمِعُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-50-41-0","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i slušaj!","en":"and listen!"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"},{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"}],"ref":"50:41","answerWord":"وَٱسْتَمِعْ","answerSound":"audio/cdef4eb14001cf7564d0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And listen on the day when the crier crieth from a near place,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["وَٱسْتَمِعْ","يَوْمَ","يُنَادِ","ٱلْمُنَادِ","مِن","مَّكَانٍ","قَرِيبٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-72-1-4","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušao je","en":"he/it listened"},{"bs":"i slušaj!","en":"and listen!"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"}],"ref":"72:1","answerWord":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","answerSound":"audio/bf11620037202874a555.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (O Muhammad): It is revealed unto me that a company of the Jinn gave ear, and they said: Lo! we have heard a marvellous Qur'an,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["قُلْ","أُوحِىَ","إِلَىَّ","أَنَّهُ","ٱسْتَمَعَ","نَفَرٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","فَقَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","سَمِعْنَا","قُرْءَانًا","عَجَبًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"istamaa-72-9-7","words":["verb:istamaa"],"options":[{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it listens"},{"bs":"i slušaj!","en":"and listen!"},{"bs":"pa slušajte!","en":"so (you all) listen!"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you listen"}],"ref":"72:9","answerWord":"يَسْتَمِعِ","answerSound":"audio/064b568f4ae6da2eb239.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And we used to sit on places (high) therein to listen. But he who listeneth now findeth a flame in wait for him;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slušati, pažljivo slušati","en":"to listen"},"passage":["وَأَنَّا","كُنَّا","نَقْعُدُ","مِنْهَا","مَقَٰعِدَ","لِلسَّمْعِ","فَمَن","يَسْتَمِعِ","ٱلْءَانَ","يَجِدْ","لَهُۥ","شِهَابًا","رَّصَدًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَمَعَ"}},{"id":"intaha-2-192-1","words":["verb:intaha"],"options":[{"bs":"prestanu","en":"they desist"},{"bs":"prestaju","en":"they stop"},{"bs":"pa je prestao","en":"so he/it stopped"},{"bs":"prestanite!","en":"(you all) stop!"}],"ref":"2:192","answerWord":"ٱنتَهَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/9e7bfe534721b11607b6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But if they desist, then lo! Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prestati, okaniti se","en":"to stop, to desist"},"passage":["فَإِنِ","ٱنتَهَوْا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"انتَهَى"}},{"id":"intaha-5-73-16","words":["verb:intaha"],"options":[{"bs":"prestaju","en":"they stop"},{"bs":"prestanu","en":"they desist"},{"bs":"pa prestanite!","en":"so (you all) stop!"},{"bs":"prestane","en":"he desists"}],"ref":"5:73","answerWord":"يَنتَهُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/29cc9da4cf56cd5fcaf8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They surely disbelieve who say: Lo! Allah is the third of three; when there is no Allah save the One Allah. If they desist not from so saying a painful doom will fall on those of them who disbelieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prestati, okaniti se","en":"to stop, to desist"},"passage":["لَّقَدْ","كَفَرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ثَالِثُ","ثَلَٰثَةٍ","وَمَا","مِنْ","إِلَٰهٍ","إِلَّآ","إِلَٰهٌ","وَٰحِدٌ","وَإِن","لَّمْ","يَنتَهُوا۟","عَمَّا","يَقُولُونَ","لَيَمَسَّنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِنْهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"انتَهَى"}},{"id":"intaha-36-18-6","words":["verb:intaha"],"options":[{"bs":"prestajete","en":"you (all) stop"},{"bs":"prestane","en":"he desists"},{"bs":"prestaju","en":"they stop"},{"bs":"prestanite!","en":"(you all) stop!"}],"ref":"36:18","answerWord":"تَنتَهُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4c35b752e1f76f421a5e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(The people of the city) said: We augur ill of you. If ye desist not, we shall surely stone you, and grievous torture will befall you at our hands.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prestati, okaniti se","en":"to stop, to desist"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","تَطَيَّرْنَا","بِكُمْ","لَئِن","لَّمْ","تَنتَهُوا۟","لَنَرْجُمَنَّكُمْ","وَلَيَمَسَّنَّكُم","مِّنَّا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"انتَهَى"}},{"id":"intaha-96-15-3","words":["verb:intaha"],"options":[{"bs":"prestane","en":"he desists"},{"bs":"prestanite!","en":"(you all) stop!"},{"bs":"pa je prestao","en":"so he/it stopped"},{"bs":"prestajete","en":"you (all) stop"}],"ref":"96:15","answerWord":"يَنتَهِ","answerSound":"audio/65d05cf075a560602533.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but if he cease not We will seize him by the forelock -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prestati, okaniti se","en":"to stop, to desist"},"passage":["كَلَّا","لَئِن","لَّمْ","يَنتَهِ","لَنَسْفَعًۢا","بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"انتَهَى"}},{"id":"intaha-9-12-17","words":["verb:intaha"],"options":[{"bs":"prestaju","en":"they stop"},{"bs":"prestajete","en":"you (all) stop"},{"bs":"prestanu","en":"they desist"},{"bs":"pa je prestao","en":"so he/it stopped"}],"ref":"9:12","answerWord":"يَنتَهُونَ","answerSound":"audio/843e702c993af11038dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they break their pledges after their treaty (hath been made with you) and assail your religion, then fight the heads of disbelief - Lo! they have no binding oaths - in order that they may desist.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prestati, okaniti se","en":"to stop, to desist"},"passage":["وَإِن","نَّكَثُوٓا۟","أَيْمَٰنَهُم","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِ","عَهْدِهِمْ","وَطَعَنُوا۟","فِى","دِينِكُمْ","فَقَٰتِلُوٓا۟","أَئِمَّةَ","ٱلْكُفْرِ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَآ","أَيْمَٰنَ","لَهُمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَنتَهُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"انتَهَى"}}]